# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS. Prettier, the design-system kit hashes and the
# participant packet verifier compare exact bytes, so CRLF checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) fail.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
